+
+| Attribute | Value |
+|-----------|-------|
+| **Title** | Federated Identity Provider (Workload Identity Federation) |
+| **Status** | Implemented |
+| **Authors** | Harbor Community |
+| **Date** | December 2024 |
+| **Version** | 1.0 |
+| **Related** | [Kubernetes KEP-4412](https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements/issues/4412) |
+
+---
+
